<title>JORDAN: Jordan seeks 15,000 T rice for October shipment.</title>
<headline>Jordan seeks 15,000 T rice for October shipment.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan is seeking to buy 15,OOO tonnes of medium grain camolina rice for shipment in October, officials said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They said offers for the rice must be received by Jordan's Ministry of Supply by September 18. Jordan's consumption of rice is 80,000-90,000 tonnes annually. --Amman Newsroom +9626-623776</p>
</text>
